<section id="hero" aria-label="The throw" data-surface="dark" class="relative bg-charcoal" style="height:700vh"><div class="sticky top-0 h-screen w-full overflow-hidden supports-[height:100svh]:h-svh"><p class="sr-only">A film in three dimensions: two hands throw a vase on a pottery wheel in a dark studio, from a lump of wet clay to a tall vessel with a celadon glaze. Scroll to move through it.</p><div aria-hidden="true" class="hero-enter-stage absolute inset-0"></div><canvas aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full"></canvas><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 85% 75% at 55% 45%, rgba(27, 23, 20, 0) 55%, rgba(14, 11, 9, 0.6) 100%)"></div><p class="mono-label hero-enter-fade pointer-events-none absolute left-[6vw] top-24 text-bone/80 md:top-28">ARGJILË — Handmade ceramics</p><div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-[6vw] will-change-transform bottom-[22vh] max-w-[44vw]"><h1 class="font-heading text-[clamp(3.25rem,6.2vw,8rem)] leading-[0.88] tracking-[-0.02em] text-bone"><span class="hero-intro-line reveal-line"><span style="animation-delay:0.35s">Made <em class="italic text-terracotta">slowly,</em></span></span><span class="hero-intro-line reveal-line"><span style="animation-delay:0.5s">by hand.</span></span></h1></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute flex items-end gap-4 text-bone bottom-[8vh] right-[6vw]"><span class="mono-label hero-enter-fade" style="animation-delay:1.1s">Scroll to throw ↓</span><span class="relative block w-px overflow-hidden bg-bone/15 h-14"><span class="scroll-line absolute inset-0 bg-bone"></span></span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute left-[6vw] flex items-center gap-3 text-bone opacity-0 bottom-[6vh]"><span class="mono-label text-bone/60">01 — Hands</span><span class="block h-px w-8 bg-bone/30"></span><span class="mono-label"></span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-n